[{"id":8907220,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-transformer/merge_requests/8936","diff_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-transformer/merge_requests/8936/diffs","number":8936,"state":"merged","title":"fix: disable gsMerge when systemPrefix and no quant for FIA","body":"## 描述\nGS1合轴路径使用AttentionmaskCopyGS1处理mask，在KV prefix场景下其s2StartIdx为全局坐标，超过attenMask矩阵范围导致BAND_MODE mask计算异常。禁用合轴后走标准AttenMaskCopyIn路径修复。\n\n## 改动\n- 在SetGSMerge中，当systemPrefixMaxLen > 0时强制gsMergeFlag_=false、pfaMergeFlag_=false\n- ROPE_SPLIT_D512分支同步禁用gsMerge\n- 非prefix场景不受影响，gsMerge正常启用\n\n## 关联的Issue\n#3841\n\n## 测试\n- prefix BAND_MODE场景精度验证通过\n- 非prefix场景行为不变\n\n## 类型标签\n- [x] \uD83D\uDC1B Bug 修复\n- [ ] ✨ 新特性\n- [ ] ⚡ 性能优化\n- [ ] ♻️ 重构\n- [ ] \uD83E\uDDEA 测试\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDCE6 构建/CI\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDD27 配置变更\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDCDD 文档更新\n- [ ] ⬆️ 依赖升级\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDD12 安全修复\n- [ ] \uD83E\uDDF9 代码清理\n- [ ] ❓ 其他，请描述：","created_at":"2026-07-20T16:58:02.314+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-22T11:16:40.364+08:00","merged_at":"2026-07-22T11:16:33.517+08:00","head":{"ref":"fix/fix-prefix-offset-bug-clean","sha":"610ab5c724da152eb31ba2364b76bbde1da3b4ed","repo":{"path":"ops-transformer","name":"ops-transformer","full_name":"haijie_699874/ops-transformer"},"assigner":{"login":"haijie_699874","name":"张海杰"}},"base":{"ref":"master","sha":"bdde57739063f0209727154d9131f7679bc69a81","repo":{"path":"ops-transformer","name":"ops-transformer","full_name":"cann/ops-transformer"}},"assignees":[],"testers":[],"labels":[{"id":4929,"color":"#2865E0","name":"cann-cla/yes","created_at":"2025-06-21T10:53:09+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-21T09:52:26+08:00"},{"id":3873,"color":"#21BA45","name":"ci-pipeline-passed","created_at":"2025-06-10T14:17:23+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-21T20:28:22+08:00"},{"id":22553,"color":"#3ee029","name":"api-check-pass","created_at":"2025-12-16T09:45:21+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-21T20:27:34+08:00"},{"id":2742,"color":"#22ed07","name":"approved","created_at":"2025-05-29T20:14:31+08:00","updated